---
import SectionTitle from "./SectionTitle.astro";
import { icon } from "../lib/icons";
import { SPOTIFY_EMBED } from "../lib/config";
---
<div class="wrap">
  <SectionTitle title="Música" sub="Comparte tus canciones favoritas" />
  <div class="music-card">
    <div class="music-intro">
      <div class="music-emblem" aria-hidden="true" set:html={icon("music")}></div>
      <div>
        <div class="music-kicker">Nuestra playlist</div>
        <h3>La música de nuestra historia</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="music-copy">
      Ayúdanos a crear la banda sonora de este día con esa canción que te hace bailar,
      recordar o sonreír.
    </p>
    <div class="music-divider"><span>✦</span></div>
    <div class="spotify-shell">
      <div class="spotify-label"><i></i> Playlist colaborativa</div>
      <iframe
        src={SPOTIFY_EMBED}
        title="Playlist de la boda de Cristian y Jimena"
        width="100%"
        height="152"
        frameborder="0"
        allow="autoplay;clipboard-write;encrypted-media;fullscreen;picture-in-picture"
        loading="lazy"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="music-request">
      <span>¿Qué canción no puede faltar?</span>
      <button class="btn sage" id="btnPlaylist"><span set:html={icon("plus")}></span>Agregar canción</button>
      <p>La propuesta se abrirá en Spotify para que puedas añadirla a la lista.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="height:20px"></div>
</div>

<style>
  .music-card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 22px 18px 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(184, 150, 90, 0.42);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(230, 212, 171, 0.5), transparent 38%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 253, 248, 0.96), rgba(243, 233, 210, 0.78));
    box-shadow: 0 20px 42px -32px rgba(74, 65, 54, 0.7);
  }
  .music-card::before,
  .music-card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.62;
  }
  .music-card::before {
    top: 10px;
    left: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
  }
  .music-card::after {
    right: 10px;
    bottom: 10px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
  }
  .music-intro {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 2px 4px 0;
  }
  .music-emblem {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(184, 150, 90, 0.55);
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--color-gold-d);
    background: rgba(255, 253, 248, 0.72);
  }
  .music-emblem :global(.svic) {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }
  .music-kicker {
    color: var(--color-gold-d);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 2.6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .music-intro h3 {
    margin: 2px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .music-copy {
    margin: 16px 5px 0;
    color: var(--color-soft);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.65;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .music-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 13px 0;
    color: var(--color-sage-d);
    font-size: 9px;
  }
  .music-divider::before,
  .music-divider::after {
    content: "";
    height: 1px;
    flex: 1;
    background: rgba(184, 150, 90, 0.34);
  }
  .spotify-shell {
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 7px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(184, 150, 90, 0.26);
    border-radius: 17px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
  }
  .spotify-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 3px 5px 9px;
    color: var(--color-soft);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 1.6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .spotify-label i {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-sage);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(155, 165, 137, 0.14);
  }
  .spotify-shell iframe {
    display: block;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 11px;
  }
  .music-request {
    padding: 17px 3px 1px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .music-request > span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .music-request p {
    margin: 9px 4px 0;
    color: var(--color-soft);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { PLAYLIST } from "../lib/config";
  document.getElementById("btnPlaylist")?.addEventListener("click", () => window.open(PLAYLIST, "_blank"));
</script>
